      "description": "The GNOME Display Manager",
      "note": "Update to 50.3\n\n* Fixed pam_gdm regression where a previous security fix caused authentication to fail on systemd, which intentionally leaves the kernel keyring buffer unterminated  [Adrian; !391]\n* Fixed potential use-after-free where gdm-session-settings did not keep a reference to the user, which could be freed by the manager while it was still emitting signals  [Ignacio; !392]\n* Fixed connection reference leaks and a use-after-free crash in session worker connection teardown that could bring down the whole user session during screen lock/unlock  [pozsy; !385]\n* Translation updates\n\nContributors:\n\n* Adrian Vovk, Ignacio Casal Quinteiro, Nathan Follens, pozsy"
